<script>
	let name = $state('world');
</script>

With `component_mode: 'all'` in `mdsvex.config.json`, HTML you type is
replaced too, not only markdown.

## A markdown heading

<h2>A typed heading, replaced as well</h2>

<svelte:element this={'h2'}>svelte:element is never replaced</svelte:element>

A lowercase tag matching an export needs no import:

<warning>

Markdown *inside* still works, {name}.

</warning>

An element with a directive stays an element, as a component can't take one:

<input bind:value={name} />
